task_context.problem_statement:
Let \[f(n) =
\begin{cases}
4n+3 &\text{if }n<a, \\
7n-12 &\text{if }n\ge{a}.
\end{cases}
\]Find $a$ if the graph of $y=f(n)$ is continuous.

